  "ingredients": [
    "2 medium avocado",
    "2 medium lime (juiced and zested)",
    "1/4 cup erythritol",
    "1 cup unsweetened carton coconut milk",
    "1/4 teaspoon liquid stevia",
    "1/2 cup fresh cilantro (chopped, adjust amount to taste)"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Slice the avocados in half and use a knife to remove the pits (firmly drive the blade of the knife into the pit and carefully twist it out).",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/cilantro-infused-avocado-lime-sorbet/#wprm-recipe-51153-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/05/IMG_4709.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Slice the avocado flesh vertically, making about five slices per half. Use a spoon to carefully scoop out the flesh. Place the sliced avocado on a foil-lined baking sheet and squeeze over one-quarter of the lime juice (this will help keep the avocado from turning brown).",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/cilantro-infused-avocado-lime-sorbet/#wprm-recipe-51153-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/05/IMG_4719.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Freeze for at least 3 hours. Start the next steps about 2 1/2 hours after putting the avocado in the freezer.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/cilantro-infused-avocado-lime-sorbet/#wprm-recipe-51153-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/05/IMG_4720.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Use a spice grinder to process the erythritol into a fine powder (think confectioner's sugar). Let settle before opening lid.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/cilantro-infused-avocado-lime-sorbet/#wprm-recipe-51153-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/05/IMG_4807.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bring the coconut milk to a boil in a pan over high heat.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/cilantro-infused-avocado-lime-sorbet/#wprm-recipe-51153-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/05/IMG_4808.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, zest the limes.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/cilantro-infused-avocado-lime-sorbet/#wprm-recipe-51153-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/05/IMG_4819.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Once the coconut milk is boiling, add the lime zest and continue to let the milk reduce.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/cilantro-infused-avocado-lime-sorbet/#wprm-recipe-51153-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/05/IMG_4822.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Once reduced by about 25%, remove and place into a container.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/cilantro-infused-avocado-lime-sorbet/#wprm-recipe-51153-step-0-7",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/05/IMG_4834.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Store the coconut milk mixture in the freezer and let cool completely.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/cilantro-infused-avocado-lime-sorbet/#wprm-recipe-51153-step-0-8",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/05/IMG_4835.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Finely chop the cilantro.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/cilantro-infused-avocado-lime-sorbet/#wprm-recipe-51153-step-0-9",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/05/IMG_4848.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove the avocados from the freezer — they should be completely frozen along with the lime juice.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/cilantro-infused-avocado-lime-sorbet/#wprm-recipe-51153-step-0-10",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/05/IMG_4854.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the avocado, cilantro, and remaining lime juice to a food processor. Pulse until chunky.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/cilantro-infused-avocado-lime-sorbet/#wprm-recipe-51153-step-0-11",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/05/IMG_4857.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour in the coconut milk mixture and add the liquid stevia.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/cilantro-infused-avocado-lime-sorbet/#wprm-recipe-51153-step-0-12",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/05/IMG_4867.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pulse until desired consistency is reached (about 2–3 minutes).",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/cilantro-infused-avocado-lime-sorbet/#wprm-recipe-51153-step-0-13",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/05/IMG_4868.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve immediately or return to the freezer for later. Enjoy!",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/cilantro-infused-avocado-lime-sorbet/#wprm-recipe-51153-step-0-14",
      "imageSource": null
    }
  ],
